  "compute": "# Bessel ripple windowed by an error-function shell:\n#   output = j0(freq * r) * erf(falloff * (radius - r)),  r = |pos|\np = self.pos\nr = float(np.sqrt(p[0] * p[0] + p[1] * p[1] + p[2] * p[2]))\nripple = float(j0(self.freq * r))\nwindow = float(erf(self.falloff * (self.radius - r)))\nself.outValue = float(ripple * window)\n",
